content:
We need to produce correct JSON. Let's construct string carefully.

Inner route JSON (no line breaks):

{
"type":"mol",
"smiles":"[CH2:1]=[C:2]([c:3]1[cH:4][cH:5][cH:6][cH:7][cH:8]1)[C@@H:9]1[CH2:10][CH2:11][CH2:12][C@@:13]1([OH:14])[C:15]([F:16])([F:17])[F:18]",
"children":[
  {
    "type":"reaction",
    "template_id":"1209837",
    "children":[
      {"type":"mol","smiles":"C=C(C)C(=O)O[C@@]1(C(F)(F)F)CCC[C@H]1C(=C)c1ccccc1"}
    ]
  }
]
}

Now escape double quotes: replace " with \". Also need to escape backslashes? Not needed.

Escaped string:

{\"type\":\"mol\",\"smiles\":\"[CH2:1]=[C:2]([c:3]1[cH:4][cH:5][cH:6][cH:7][cH:8]1)[C@@H:9]1[CH2:10][CH2:11][CH2:12][C@@:13]1([OH:14])[C:15]([F:16])([F:17])[F:18]\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"reaction\",\"template_id\":\"1209837\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"mol\",\"smiles\":\"C=C(C)C(=O)O[C@@]1(C(F)(F)F)CCC[C@H]1C(=C)c1ccccc1\"}]}]}

Now outer JSON: {"route":"<escaped string>"}.

Thus action_input JSON:

{
  "route":"{\"type\":\"mol\",\"smiles\":\"[CH2:1]=[C:2]([c:3]1[cH:4][cH:5][cH:6][cH:7][cH:8]1)[C@@H:9]1[CH2:10][CH2:11][CH2:12][C@@:13]1([OH:14])[C:15]([F:16])([F:17])[F:18]\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"reaction\",\"template_id\":\"1209837\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"mol\",\"smiles\":\"C=C(C)C(=O)O[C@@]1(C(F)(F)F)CCC[C@H]1C(=C)c1ccccc1\"}]}]}"
}

Now produce tool call.
